{"id":"vod_lz_31188","vodId":"31188","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"死神","name_cn":"死神","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220820-1/f67abadab2888489937e1ee65c152e95.jpg"},"summary":"　　橘发少年黑崎一护是个正义感爆棚的高中生，与父亲、两个妹妹共同生活，从小他就有能看见鬼魂的本事，但并不以为意。一天夜里一只叫“虚”的怪物攻击了一护和他的家人，尾随怪物而来的死神朽木露琪亚身负重伤，只得将灵力转给一护，由他代死神之职。岂料“代职”一发不可收拾，一段时间后，尸 魂界发现露琪亚的违规行为，来人将她抓走。为救出朋友，一护在浦原商店店主浦原喜助的帮助下，集结了井上织姬、石田雨龙、茶渡泰虎几位好友，一同前往尸魂界。与此同时，尸魂界瀞灵廷内一场惊天阴谋也在慢慢掀开……　　《死神》漫画于2001年开始在《少年JUMP周刊》连载，动画2004年开播。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动作,动画,惊悚,奇幻,冒险"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-08-20 02:32:54","classic":true,"classicRank":38,"franchise":"死神","playable":true,"episodeCount":366,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20220817/22481_342a8e06/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20220817/22480_541fda28/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20220817/22482_927ae417/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20220817/22483_e8faabd9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20220817/22484_aa247031/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20220817/22485_175352d9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20220817/22486_8db1e532/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20220817/22488_500a9907/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20220817/22487_7904ee18/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20220817/22489_5679f6d3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20220817/22490_6d73c2d4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20220817/22491_5b264c67/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20220817/22492_dbbae63e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20220817/22493_af